msgctxt "80"
msgid "Eeeeeeep! Somebody help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Well? Did that loosen your tongue?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"I think I might've bit my tongue, as a matter of fact...\r\n"
"Anyway, what do you want from me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"I'm looking for bouncers on behalf of a casino, and we could\r\n"
"use your knowledge of weapons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Weapons, you say! In that case, I'm your man! Stun guns...\r\n"
"handguns... You name it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Bouncers can use weapons whenever they want, right!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Well... Yeah, I guess so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Really!? And I can use the stuff at the club, right!? Hmm,\r\n"
"I wonder if they got anything rare... There's only so much\r\n"
"you can buy online..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Okay, look. The place is in a building on Park Boulevard.\r\n"
"I'll give you the number. You can go there whenever you're\r\n"
"ready. Sound good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Shoot, I'll head over there right away! Oh, and the name's\r\n"
"Hirano!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "I can put my weapons to work here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Don't worry, Rumi-chan! I'll protect you!"
msgstr ""

